Subject: Why I'm no fundy (was: MOVIE: "Johnny Mnemo

Craig Pression wrote ...

>In <9311021421.aa26112@ruddles.sco.com>, Charlie Stross writes:
>|> >From: Harry Shapiro <habs@panix.com>
